GESTURE CONTOL

GESTURE 1: Index Finger = Move Cursor ---
GESTURE 2: Index + Middle = Click ---  (Move cursor while in click mode)
GESTURE 3: Fist (no fingers) = Drag ---
GESTURE 4: Pinch (Thumb + Index close) = Volume/Brightness Control --- (Vertical movement controls volume)(Horizontal movement controls brightness)
GESTURE 5: Peace Sign (Index + Middle spread) = Right Click ---
GESTURE 6: All fingers up = Scroll ---

[imp : v sign with index finger and middle finger move cursor, close the v sign index and middle finger join toger will click]


**********************************************************************************************************************************

EYE CONTROLL

Left eye blink -- Left click
Right eye blink -- Right click
blink both eye -- select